 d educational courses.\n\nDeadlines\nSession proposal submission: 2026-0
 5-13\nAbstract submission: 2026-09-21\nEarly registration: 2027-01-27\nP
 resenter confirmation and registration: 2027-02-01\n\nhttps://epa-congre
 ss.org/
